<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- NAMBYA TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo Lwobili LwaPaulu Kuna Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Lwabili LwaPaulu</para>
  <para style="mt1">KUNATIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">Matangisilo</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwhalo yaTimoti yabili lukwalo lwakakwalwa naPaulu uMpositoli lunda kundayijwa uwe Timoti. Timoti webili lwakakwalwa zwindakumapejelejo obupenyu bwaPaulu. Nooyu unshaji wakabigwa muntolongo kuRoma (2 Timoti 1.16). Paulu wakabe whananana kasa naTimoti akale wakabonshoba kuti mwananhulumyana uwe (baFilipi 2.22, 1 Timoti 1.2, 1.18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeyi imwe yewhalo ina yakakwalwa naPaulu lunda kunhu kusi kugubungano. Amwe makwalo ndiTimoti woTanga, Tayitasi, naFilimoni. Nonshaji kukwalwaTimoti waBili, bakristo mubushe bweRoma bakabeli mukuyabiswa. Yechi chingaba chisoko chokuba muntolongo kwaPaulu, akale wakabepa Timoti indayijo yokuti Timoti ebe unosima mbeli kobulemu. SomunaTimoti woTanga, Paulu unopa Timoti zwichenjejo zwinji nabalayiji boniepa (1 Timoti 1. 16-18). Akale unobuja Timoti kuti kuna mishaji mikukutu mbeli (2 Timoti 3.1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu unotanga nokumusa Timoti (2 Timoti 1:1-2) nokuunsungwaja (2 Timoti 1:3-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kova esungwaja Timoti kuti ezwisimise (2 Timoti 2:1-13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zwakatobela wakapa Timoti indayilo yemishaji yose (2 Timoti 2:14-26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kova onchenjeja nezwimuzha akale nenzila ili iyo yokuzwilwisa (2 Timoti 3:1—4.8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu unopejeleja nejimwe ndebo jilonangana naTimoti (2 Timoti 4:9-24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Imi Paulu umpositoli waKristo Jesu nechido chaMwali zwindila muchibimbiso chobupenyu bumo munaKristo Jesu.<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Kuna Timoti mwana wangu unodikana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Mwali Tate naTezi wedu Kristo Jesu bekupe chipiwo, ishe, nolunyalalo.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuboka Nokusungwaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Ndoboka Mwali wandinoshingila nomyoyo unchena, sezwakata matategulu angu, pandinomukumbuluka unshaji wose muminamato yangu masikati nobusiku. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Pandinokumbulukwa mishoji yiyo, ndozwimba kukubona, kutila kuti ndizhajwe nolushanto. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ndokumbulukwa kudimbwa kuko kwechokomende, kudimbwa kwakatanga kuna amegulu babo Loyisi nokuna mai babo Yunisi akale ngweno ndosimisa kuti kumo mwauli. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Nokudalo ndinokukumbuluja kuti ufulijile chipo chaMwali chimo mwauli chakava mukukubiga kwangu maboko, <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />nokuti Mwali aajakatipa umpepo wolutyo koga umpepo wesimba, ludo nokuzwibhata.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Nokudalo usibe neshoni kusumikija zwaTezi wedu, kana nozwangu imi unsungwa uwe, koga tambula kuyabulila indebo imbuya mumasimba aMwali, <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />kuvila kumatangisilo iye wakatichija akale akatishoba, kuti tibe bachena zwisinovila mumishingo yedu koga zwili zwechinangwa chiche nechipiwo chaakatipa munaKristo Jesu makole manji apinda. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Yechi chipiwo chakatondejela nokuzha koNchiji wedu Kristo Jesu, Iye wakajima lufu akabuza bupenyu businopela nokumunika nendebo imbuya.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Nokudalo ndakabigwa kuba umbhaunuli, umpositoli, nondayiji, <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />akale nokudalo ndizwo ndilimukuyabula ali. Koga azwitondipe shoni, nokuti ndinonziba wandakadimbwa, akale ndinobimba kuti unotubula kulinda zwaakandilondotesa kuswikila yelyo izhuba. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Tobela igwala lyontimbo wamawhi angu echokomende awakawha kunami, mukudimbwa akale noludo zwimo munaKristo Jesu, <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />londota chinhu chibuya chawakatambikwa noMpepo uNchena unogala mwatili.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Unoziba kuti bose bokuEzhiya bakanditizha, akale bamwe babo ndiFijelasi naHemojinisi. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Tezi ngewhile ishe imhuli yaOnesifolasi, nokuti unshaji unji wakabendimusilija, aajakabeli neshoni namaketani angu, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Paakaswika kuRoma wakandipyanga nokusungwala mane akandiwana <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />ngana Tezi boopa ishe jabo nelyo izhuba akale iwi unoziba zwibuyanana mishingo yose yaakata kuEfeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Undwi ulobimbika waKristo Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Iwi nino, mwananhulumyana wangu, sima muchipiwo chimo munaKristo Jesu, <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />akale zwiwakawha kwandili mbeli kwabasumikiji banji zwilondotese banhu balobimbika akale bachatubula kulayija bamwebo.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Iwi tambula kujiila sondwi umbuyanana waKristo Jesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Apana undwi unoti elipa nshingo unongwinila zwinotiwa nabanhu koga, nokuti chinangwa chiche ngichokuguncha wakompanshingo. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Unkwikwiji atoombajwa chilemba kuzhe kokuti ekwikwije zwimo mumulawo. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Undimi unoshinga nesimba ndiye unokwelela kutanga kuwana unkobe wezwilyo. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Yeyesesa pezhulu pezwandinoleba, nokuti Tezi unookupa kuwhisisa muzwinhu zwose yezwi.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Kumbulukwa Jesu Kristo, wakamuswa mubafi, unzekululu waDavidi, sezwino bhaunulwa mundebo imbuya yangu, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />indebo imbuya yandimuyabisilwa ndakasungwa namaketani sombipisi. Koga iwhi lyaMwali alijilosungwa namaketani. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Nokudalo ndozwimilila zwose kutila kuti baloshalwa, neebo bewane luchijo munaKristo Jesu bewane kungaima kusinopela. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Isumo ine chokomende kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">kana tafa naye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">toolalama naye.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Tingosimilila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">tootonga naye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">kana tingoondamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">iye neebo, unootilamba,<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />kana, tisilobimbika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">iye unolamba akabimbika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">nokuti, aangazwilambe, nokukwe.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unshingi uLovumilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Ubakumbuluje yezwi zwinhu, akale ubalaye pambeli paMwali kuti belekeje kunyenyejana nozwa mabala, zwisinobhancha, koga zwipalaja banowhilila. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Ute zwose zwimo mumasimba awo kuti uzwipile kunaMwali sonhu ulovumilwa, unshingi usilokwelela kuba neshoni, unolayija iwhi lyechokomende zwilokwelela. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Iba kule nokukwejisa zwisina bumwali, nokuti zwinotungamilila banhu mukusotya Mwali kasakasa, <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />akale indebo yabo inopalalila sechilonda chisino chila. Mukati mwabo muna naHayimaneyasi naFiletasi, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />ibo babhuda muchokomende beti kumuka kubafi kwakatikana kale. Bamubulaya kudimbwa kwabamwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Koga chimisikilo chaMwali chimile chisimu nemhande yamabala yawa “Tezi unobaziba babe,” akale, “Wose unoshoba izina lyaTezi ebhude mububi.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Mungumba ihulwana amuna chete zwibigilo zwendalama nesiliva koga munowanikwabo zwezwi kunyana nozwevu, akale zwimwe zwemishingo mikulwana, zwimwe zwemishingo ipasi. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Kana aani angozwichenesa muzwinhu zwibi, unoba chibigilo chezwinokujwa, chilo cheneswa akale china nshingo kunaTezi wengumba, chilo milila kana upi zwawo unshingo umbuya. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Nokudalo tizha zwilakamilo zwobutukutuku unange bululami, kudimbwa, ludo, nolunyalalo, pamwempela naabo banoshomeja Tezi nomwoyo unchena. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Nokudalo bhuda mukunyenyejana kuna bulema kusina maano, kwaunoziba kuti kunozwala kukakabajana. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Akale unshingi waTezi aatokwelela kuba wokukakabajana koga uneshe kunhu wose, unotubula kulayija, unamwoyo undefu, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />elulamisa banounyenyeja zwinyolonyolo. Umwe unshaji Mwali angabata kuti beshanduke akale bezibe ichokomende, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Akale bangoobwilila mundangalilo jabo imbuya kova bepunyuka mukalabwi kaGuluzhanje, kuva mubuzike bubwe bokuta chido chiche.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Mazhuba okuPejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Koga whisisa yezwi, kuti mumazhuba okupejeleja kunooba nemishaji yobulemu. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Nokuti banhu banooba banozwilobefuba, banoodisisisa imali, banooba banoshiya, banozwida,banotuka, basinowhilila bazwali babo, basinoboka, basi bachena, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />basina bunhu, basino kabulika, banopita, basino zwikabula, banotyisa, babengi bobubuya, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />bacheti, bane bhwelempwele, banozwida, banoda kunakililwa panakuti bede Mwali, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />banota sabano namata asi belamba isimba lyako. Banhu bakadalo siyanani nabo. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Nokuti mukati mwabo muna yabo banongwina mujingumba betapa banhukaji matela, balolemelwa noluchinyo akale beyumbwa nendakamilo jilosiyanasiyana. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Banhukaji yaba banowhilila kana aani koga basinowana luzibo lwechokomende. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />SaJenisi naJambulesi bakanyenyeja Mozesi, nokudalo yaba banhu naibo banonyenyeja ichokomende, banhu bane ndangalilo imbi akale bana kudimbwa kusili kwelebeswa koniepa, <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />koga abatoonda kule, nokuti bulema bwabo bunooba pachena kunhu wose, sezwa yabaya banhulume babili.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indayilo yoPejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Ngweno iwi wabona indayijo yangu, untilo wangu, chinangwa changu mubupenyu, kudimbwa kwangu, moyo undefu wangu, ludo lwangu, kusungwala kwangu, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />kuyabiswa kwangu, injabulo jangu, zwakatikana kwandili kuAntiyoki, kuIkoniyumu, nokuLisitila, ilo luyabiso lwandakamila, koga Tezi wakandinuna muna izo zwose. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Chokomende wose unachido chokulalama bupenyu bobumwali munaKristo Jesu unooyabiswa, <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />koga banhu babi nezwintwakubili banoondila mbeli mububi bwabo, banochenga naibo banochengwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Koga iwi, indilambeli munozwawakalayijwa akale ukadimbwa nesimba, uziba kuti ndiyani wakakulayija, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />akale kuva kubutukutuku bubo ulojizibila iwhalo inchena jinotubula kukulayija zwoluchijo nokudimbwa munaKristo Jesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Iwhalo inchena jose jakafemelwa naMwali akale jinobhancha mukulayija, mukukabula, mukululamisa nomukulayija mubululami, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />kuti unhu waMwali epelelele, ekabambanyilwa kuta mishingo mibuya yose.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Ndokulaya mbeli kwaMwali naKristo Jesu iye uchootonga bapenyu nabakafa, akale nokuzha kukwe nobushe bubwe, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />bhaunula iwhi, sungwala unshaji kana ulimbuya akale kana usili umbuya, bwetekeja, ukolola, ukalalila, akale usungwaja, nomwoyo undefu nokulayija. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Nokuti unshaji ukumuzha banhu pabachaleka kuwhilila indayilo ili iyo, koga beli nenzebe jinoluma, banoozwibunganisila balayiji banoobabuja zwabanoda, <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />akale banootukulila kuwhilila ichokomende betobela ingano. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Koga iwi, jikama unshaji wose, zwimisile kuyabula, ita unshingo wombhaunuli wendebo imbuya, zhajikija unshingo uwo.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Nokuti ndaswika kale panshaji wokuti ndipilwe sedilijo lyontebulo, unshaji wangu wokuti ndinde waswika. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Ndalwana ihondo imbuya, ndapeja unjiijano, ndalondota luvumilo. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Kuvila ngweno chilemba chobululami chandilobigilwa, chandichapiwa naTezi, untongi wobululami nelyo izhuba, kusi imi ndoga koga kunaibo bose bakada kuboneka kukwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawhi aPaulu omene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Kweja nesimba lilyo kuswika kwandili nokukambijisa, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />nokuti Dimasi, nokuda zwenyika yeeno wakanditizha, akenda kuTesalonika, Kresensi wakenda kuGalatiya, Taitasi kuDalumeshiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka ega ndiye unanami. Tola Mako uzhe naye, nokuti unalubhancho kasa kwandili pakundishingila. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Tichikasi ndakoontuma kuEfesu. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Pauchezha, undizhile neshashiko yandakasiya kunaKapasi kuTulowasi, akale newhalo, pezhulu paizwo zwose newhalo jamapapata.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alekizanda unfuli wakandilwajisa kasa, Tezi unoondanga nezwito zwizwe. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Uunchenjelele, nokuti wakanyenyeja nesimba indayo yedu.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Pakuzwitabilija kwangu kotanga apana wakama nami, bose bakanditizha. Besipiwe undandu nazwo! <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Koga Tezi wakamanami akale akandipa isimba lyokupupula indayilo zwizhele, kuti bose Bokuzhe beiwhe. Nokudalo ndakachijwa mundomo weshumba. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Tezi unoondinuna mububi bose akale unondiswincha zwibuyanana kubushe bubwe bokudenga. Lukujo lube kwaali kwemisi isinopela. Ameni.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumusa kopejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Umuse Pulisika naAkwila nemhuli yaOnesifolasi. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Elasitasi wakasala kuKolinte, Tilofimusi ndakonsiya kuMiletusi nokuti wakabelwala. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Ukweje nesimba lilyo lyose kuzha unshaji wemhepo usanu waswika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Yubhulasi ukumukumusa, naPudenisi, naLayinasi, naKilaudia nabanakwaina bose.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Tezi elondote umpepo uwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Chipiwo chaMwali chibe namwi mose.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>